Speech_0067L=REDDING - The leasing company papers list a dummy corporation created by one Milos Nowak, AKA Milan Nedich. Nowak is a suspected war criminal from the Bosnian conflict. He's known as the Barber of Bosnia because he allegedly scalped some of his prisoners...
