Speech_0011L=LAMBERT - That's right.  Don't let any of them get killed.
Speech_0012L=FISHER - I won't.
Speech_0122L=LAMBERT - You just killed a civilian Fisher. Control yourself.
Speech_0013L=LAMBERT - Dammit Fisher...that's a civilian down. Control yourself.
Speech_0014L=FISHER - It was an accident. I'll be more careful.
Speech_0123L=LAMBERT - That's two civilians down. This mission is a disaster. Complete your primary objectives and forget about the rest.
Speech_0015L=LAMBERT - Fisher...that's another civilian down. This mission is a disaster. Complete your primary objectives and forget about the rest...you've lost your edge.
Speech_0016L=FISHER - Roger.
