Speech_0005L=He is I guess... but you know Carl...
Speech_0006L=Yeah... good point...

[P_06_Hokkaido_InterroAppleBlossom]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Keep it quiet...
Speech_0002L=Okay...
Speech_0003L=What's through here? 
Speech_0004L=Here? Th...the middle Shoin is that way...
Speech_0005L=Shoin? What's a shoin?
Speech_0008L=Shoin...I think it's an architectural style that gained favor during the Muromachi period when the military elite - as defined by the samurai class - grew in size and stature and largely supplanted the older nobility...
Speech_0009L=That's very informative... but do you know anything useful?
Speech_0010L=I think there's a first aid kit in one of the bedrooms.
Speech_0011L=That's better.
Speech_0020L=Please don't kill me.
Speech_0021L=It's just a place we use for R and R...

