[P_06_Hokkaido_InterroMilan]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Shhh... let's not make a scene...
Speech_0002L=NEDICH - Who are you...what do you want?
Speech_0003L=FISHER - I want to know why you're protecting Zherkezhi...how is Displace involved?
Speech_0004L=NEDICH - I won't talk.
Speech_0005L=FISHER - You gonna make me cut your throat and look for the words inside your neck?
Speech_0006L=NEDICH - Oh... god... please, let me go.
Speech_0007L=FISHER - You're not leaving here alive, Nedich, but if you tell me what I want to know, I can make the end a little easier for you.
Speech_0008L=NEDICH - The blackout...we...we needed to keep Zherkezhi safe after the blackout...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0043L=FISHER - You're gonna answer some questions.
Speech_0044L=NEDICH - Ha. Ask all you want...I won't tell you anything.
Speech_0045L=FISHER - Why not...you're dead already...it's just a question of how bumpy the rest of the road is...
Speech_0046L=NEDICH - You can't just murder me...there are rules for soldiers...I'm a prisoner of war...
Speech_0047L=FISHER - You're an un-uniformed combatant and we're officially in peace time... that makes you a terrorist...
Speech_0048L=NEDICH - So send me to Guantanamo...
Speech_0049L=FISHER - I'm gonna send pieces of you to lots of different places if you don't start talking...how is Displace involved with Zherkezhi?
Speech_0050L=NEDICH - The blackout... he gave us the algorithms for the blackout... we moved him here to protect him...
Speech_0051L=FISHER - And what about the Walsh?
Speech_0052L=NEDICH - I don't know anything about the Walsh...you'll have to ask Shetland...
Speech_0053L=FISHER - Shetland?!
Speech_0054L=NEDICH - Yeah...he needed more data from Zherkezhi after the blackouts...but we have everything we...
Speech_0055L=FISHER - Shetland knows what you're up to?!
Speech_0056L=NEDICH - Yeah...yeah...he's the boss...he gave the order to bring Zherkezhi here...
Speech_0057L=FISHER - Where is Shetland now?
Speech_0058L=NEDICH - He's on his way here now...by helicopter.
Speech_0059L=FISHER - Where is Shetland going?
Speech_0060L=NEDICH - I don't know!
Speech_0061L=FISHER - Why did he kill Zherkezhi?
Speech_0062L=NEDICH - I don't know...Zherkezhi knows too much...
Speech_0063L=FISHER - Like what? What did he know...
Speech_0064L=NEDICH - About the blackout...about how his algorithms work...
Speech_0065L=FISHER - What about the Walsh? Did Zherkezhi's algorithms have anything to do with the attack on the ship?
Speech_0066L=NEDICH - I don't know...I don't know...I just do the protection...
Speech_0067L=FISHER - Well you didn't do a very good job...
Speech_0040L=NEDICH - Finish it, or let me go.
Speech_0041L=NEDICH - Do it...or are you a coward?

[P_06_Hokkaido_InterroNedichPals]
