Speech_0041L=Not exactly sure... but this thing with the ship... maybe someone's onto us...
Speech_0042L=But what if...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0030L=Look...nevermind all that. The boss is on his way and things are heating up. We knew that would happen, so just stick to the plan, get this place tightened up and make sure that this little visit goes off without a hitch. Get movin'.
