Speech_0018L=Oh... well, uh, I looked a bit... but I didn't find any.
Speech_0019L=A bit? What does that mean? Where did you look?
Speech_0020L=Uh... like, on the table and stuff.
Speech_0021L=You looked on the table for microphones?!
Speech_0022L=Yeah.
Speech_0005L=Gee... did you find any?
Speech_0006L=Uh... no...
Speech_0007L=(sighs) Never mind... I'll look for them myself.
Speech_0008L=Okay. Well, let me know if you need any help.

