[P_06_Hokkaido_NightingaleChat]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Argh... this squeaking is driving me crazy. Sounds like I'm walking on a family of parakeets.
Speech_0002L=Nightingales... It's called a nightingale floor. Protection against ninjas.
Speech_0003L=Ninjas? There's no such thing as ninjas.
Speech_0004L=Oh yeah? Back in 2004, that thing in Georgia, I had a contract to help secure this oil rig... we got attacked by a ninja.
Speech_0005L=You're crazy.
Speech_0006L=Tell you what... you don't believe me, why don't we trade places and I'll patrol where the anti-ninja flooring is...
Speech_0007L=Fine... I'll go guard your post.
Speech_0008L=Deal.
Speech_0015L=Heh heh heh... watch out for ninja's... sucker...
Speech_0016L=They're listening...

[P_06_Hokkaido_Objectives]
Objective_0001=Eliminate Milan Nedich
Objective_0017=Milan Nedich is complicit in Zherkezhi's plans, and may be leading a rouge faction within Displace International. Exercise any opportunity to eliminate him.
Objective_0008=Abduct Abrahim Zherkezhi
Objective_0018=Abrahim Zherkezhi's weaponized algorithms are extraordinarily complex. Abduct him so that Third Echelon can interrogate him for information about his methods and plans.
Note_0025L=Paper walls are breakable and guards can be grabbed through them.
Note_0026L=Microphones can be pried out of the walls using the knife.
Note_0027L=Microphones can be seen in thermal vision.
Note_0028L=Microphones can be seen with EMF Vision.
POPUPMESSAGE_0029=Eliminate Milan Nedich.
Objective_0002=Discover the real identity of Milan Nedich
Objective_0019=Third Echelon's files draw a blank on the name Milan Nedich, Displace's VP of Protection Services. Scan his license plate to find out his real identity.
POPUPMESSAGE_0031=Eliminate Douglas Shetland.
Objective_0006=Eliminate Douglas Shetland
Objective_0020=Shetland murdered Zherkezhi to cover up information that may prevent a world war. He is also trading in classified weaponized algorithms. Exercise any opportunity to eliminate him.
Objective_0003=Retrieve the hidden microphones
Objective_0021=Admiral Otomo's I-SDF has been monitoring Displace's activities. Their agents have left detectable microphones on site. Locate and recover them to maintain OPSEC. 
Objective_0012=Record the conversation between Shetland and Zherkezhi
Objective_0022=(null)
Objective_0013=Interrogate Milan Nedich
Objective_0023=(null)
POPUPMESSAGE_0033=Exfiltrate to the primary extraction point.
Objective_0016=Exfiltrate to the primary extraction point
Objective_0024=Exfiltrate from the shore of the lake where you were inserted.

