[P_06_Hokkaido_SRC]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Many more days like today, and I'll have to retire...
Speech_0002L=Bad day?
Speech_0003L=Bad day? Hell no! It was a great day! I made almost a hundred thousand dollars today...
Speech_0004L=What? How?
Speech_0005L=The Walsh! Shares in the company! War! There's money to be made my friend!
Speech_0006L=I don't understand... we're not going to be fighting a war... the military is...
Speech_0007L=War isn't about fighting! War is about transportation, logistics, services. The army doesn't do it's own laundry... they give us billion dollar contracts to manage all that crap for them...
Speech_0008L=They do?
Speech_0009L=Sure they do...they don't want combat soldiers washing dishes... they want farm hands from central Texas doing that crap...
Speech_0010L=That makes sense...
Speech_0011L=Makes more than sense my friend... it makes the world go round... the investors know it... and I got a hundred grand in the bank that confirms it...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0012L=Hey... got my twenty bucks?
Speech_0013L=You mean from the game? Forget it. The game didn't end...they called it 'cause of the blackout.
Speech_0014L=It was in the eighth inning, the game was over...
Speech_0015L=It ain't over til it's over.
Speech_0016L=It's over when the umpire calls it in the eighth...that's the rule...
Speech_0017L=Well I didn't see no umpire call the game... it doesn't count.
Speech_0018L=But it does count...it counts in the standings, it counts for the league, it counts on the book in Vegas...
Speech_0019L=Well I ain't the book in Vegas...so I ain't payin'.
Speech_0020L=Man, you are cheap...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0021L=Did you hear the news?
Speech_0022L=About the Walsh?
Speech_0023L=No...the other news...the astronauts...
Speech_0024L=Oh...no...I forgot about them.
Speech_0025L=They just announced that their oxygen levels are still falling...the repairs weren't successful.
Speech_0026L=Oh...so...what...they're just gonna die?
Speech_0027L=The news said they're examining the possibility of a space walk to repair an external breach.
Speech_0028L=I thought they didn't have the right gear to do any space walks...
Speech_0029L=They don't.
Speech_0030L=Pfff...man...what a nightmare...

[P_06_Hokkaido_WaitAnims_Pierre]

